# LF in the working copy for every text file, on every machine. core.autocrlf=true
# on Windows was rewriting checked-out files to CRLF, which broke exact-text edit
# anchors and fed layout-diff CRLF on one side (see CLAUDE.md, the 0.1.60 and
# 0.1.65 fixes). Binary files are listed so autodetection never touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
